{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "file:packages/sandbox/sandbox-windows-acl/src/runner.ts",
   "type": "file",
   "name": "runner.ts",
   "filePath": "packages/sandbox/sandbox-windows-acl/src/runner.ts",
   "summary": "windows-acl 限制运行器：seam 用来替换调用方命令的 argv 前缀包装器——创建带 workspace 写 SID allowlist 的 WRITE_RESTRICTED token、以继承 stdio spawn 被包 argv、镜像子进程退出码（全 32 位无截断，实证记录），退出时撤销 temp grant（workspace ACE 常驻为复用缓存）；seam 托管模式校验 SID 与路径匹配且 manageDacls:false，独立模式自建随机私有 temp 目录并在子进程退出后删除；一切失败打印 windows-acl-run: 签名并退 127，子进程绝不未限制启动。",
   "tags": [
    "runner",
    "restricted-token",
    "argv-wrapper",
    "fail-closed"
   ],
   "complexity": "complex",
   "languageNotes": "runner 忽略自身 CTRL+C 以存活到撤销 grant；TMP/TEMP 在自身环境重写后经 lpEnvironment NULL 继承（显式块经 koffi 传 CreateProcessAsUserW 实证触发 ERROR_INVALID_PARAMETER）。"
  },
  {
   "id": "class:packages/sandbox/sandbox-windows-acl/src/runner.ts:RunnerFailure",
   "type": "class",
   "name": "RunnerFailure",
   "filePath": "packages/sandbox/sandbox-windows-acl/src/runner.ts",
   "lineRange": [
    58,
    58
   ],
   "summary": "Error 子类：已按契约打印过 windows-acl-run: 签名行的运行器失败标记，顶层捕获不再重复输出。",
   "tags": [
    "error-type",
    "internal",
    "runner"
   ],
   "complexity": "simple"
  },
  {
   "id": "function:packages/sandbox/sandbox-windows-acl/src/runner.ts:parseArgs",
   "type": "function",
   "name": "parseArgs",
   "filePath": "packages/sandbox/sandbox-windows-acl/src/runner.ts",
   "lineRange": [
    76,
    108
   ],
   "summary": "解析运行器稳定 argv 契约（--workspace/--temp/--mode/--write-sid/--temp-write-sid/-- 与命令），非法输入经 fail() 以签名行+127 退出。",
   "tags": [
    "argv-parsing",
    "validation",
    "cli-contract"
   ],
   "complexity": "moderate"
  },
  {
   "id": "function:packages/sandbox/sandbox-windows-acl/src/runner.ts:main",
   "type": "function",
   "name": "main",
   "filePath": "packages/sandbox/sandbox-windows-acl/src/runner.ts",
   "lineRange": [
    116,
    208
   ],
   "summary": "运行器主流程：校验两目录与 SID 配对→屏蔽自身 CTRL+C→按模式物化私有 temp（seam 托管校验匹配/独立模式 mkdtemp）→new AclSandbox + init→重写 TMP/TEMP→继承 stdio spawn 子进程（按需转发控制 FD）→镜像退出码；finally 里清理失败只报告不遮蔽子进程退出码。",
   "tags": [
    "entry-point",
    "lifecycle",
    "cleanup"
   ],
   "complexity": "complex"
  },
  {
