   "filePath": "packages/sandbox/sandbox-windows-acl/src/spawn.ts",
   "summary": "共享 Win32 进程属主之上的受限 token 适配层：把 dsh-win32-process 的 piped/kill-on-close Job spawn 与等待函数包装为带 restricted token 的三个助手，re-export drainPipe。",
   "tags": [
    "adapter",
    "spawn",
    "restricted-token"
   ],
   "complexity": "simple"
  },
